          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "sum(max_over_time(markettrader_web_vitals_cls_sum{service_name=\"$service\"}[$__range])) / sum(max_over_time(markettrader_web_vitals_cls_count{service_name=\"$service\"}[$__range]))",
          "legendFormat": "CLS",
          "range": false,
          "refId": "A",
          "instant": true
        }
      ],
      "title": "CLS (mean)",
      "type": "stat"
    },
    {
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 4,
        "x": 20,
        "y": 1
      },
      "id": 7,
      "options": {
        "code": {
          "language": "plaintext",
          "showLineNumbers": false,
          "showMiniMap": false
        },
        "content": "**Low counts are normal.** Each vital reports at most once per page view, and LCP/CLS/INP only settle when the page is hidden. A glanced-at page reports TTFB and FCP only.\n\nBecause of that sparsity the tiles and the bar gauge are **cumulative since the server started**, not windowed rates \u2014 a 5-minute `rate()` over once-per-pageview data is almost always empty. The two time-series panels stay rate-based, so they show trend rather than totals.\n\nThe SPA sets no environment attribute, so an environment filter would empty this board.",
        "mode": "markdown"
      },
      "title": "Reading this board",
      "type": "text"
    },
